		{"id":"3ab33f8676b8a714","type":"text","text":"For too long, Bali has veiled in darkness, under Karma’s heavy hand","x":98,"y":6296,"width":397,"height":66,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f01034abdb1bdc00","type":"text","text":"5. IT is believed that this figure... will be the one that brings Bali back into light, they will be the dawn that shine this longest night.","x":-796,"y":6200,"width":397,"height":98,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b86a662846ff13f7","type":"text","text":"6. The night is here, it has encapsulates this place for so long, under Karma's tyranny everthing has been shrouded in endless night","x":-796,"y":6298,"width":397,"height":133,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"24b7d50d28d6f24a","type":"text","text":"And in his name, we believe a dawn will come to break the darkness.","x":606,"y":6299,"width":397,"height":98,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4f4b732f6577bfb2","type":"text","text":"For without Aruna, Surya’s fire is trapped, we would wander in a world without dawn. Forever in darkness.","x":606,"y":6397,"width":397,"height":133,"color":"1"},
