		{"id":"9f37d941f15684ca","type":"text","text":"For too long, Bali has veiled in darkness, under Karma’s heavy hand","x":-355,"y":6289,"width":397,"height":66,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7af25accfaa68fd4","type":"text","text":"6. WIthout Aruna to pull Surya's chariot... the world is encapsulated in endless night.","x":-355,"y":6355,"width":397,"height":133,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cff699db6ca034da","type":"text","text":"3. Say... are you familiar with the legends of Aruna?","x":-796,"y":6048,"width":357,"height":68,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5046a34151ecf106","type":"text","text":"4.  It's an old story, told of an egg hatched too early, ","x":-796,"y":6116,"width":397,"height":84,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"442828446c08b467","type":"text","text":"He is the charioteer of the sun god Surya. ","x":1097,"y":6296,"width":397,"height":81,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a4c676271772e815","type":"text","text":"7. ","x":1360,"y":6860,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"366aa05e42ffb37a","type":"text","text":"Are you... Aruna?","x":1097,"y":6715,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3028f7db9f534764","type":"text","text":"7. He lets go, if fate dictates it, she will come back if not, then she will go.","x":2000,"y":6944,"width":250,"height":152,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2f4e141291565917","type":"text","text":"Yet now, I sit here, with only my memories to remember what once was.","x":606,"y":6016,"width":357,"height":64,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e9e3bf898ab11cdc","type":"text","text":"Say... are you familiar with the legends of Aruna? ","x":606,"y":6082,"width":357,"height":68,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d9b67f7448f4b743","type":"text","text":"They say Aruna was born too soon, a child of the dawn. Too early for this world, yet destined for it.","x":606,"y":6149,"width":397,"height":84,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"680a348856d21c24","type":"text","text":"For too long, Bali has been veiled in darkness, under Karma’s reign","x":606,"y":6233,"width":397,"height":66,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"30cbe93d7b91ce2b","type":"text","text":"6. The girl is still in denial, she is still a long way before understanding this.","x":2000,"y":6724,"width":250,"height":107,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"83c1597559914e25","type":"text","text":"Are you Aruna?","x":98,"y":6587,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b82cd8247e161024","type":"text","text":"Say... are you familiar with the legends of Aruna? ","x":1097,"y":6077,"width":357,"height":68,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"39c61a66e9d845fd","type":"text","text":"(Aksara shook her head) Sorry","x":1097,"y":6150,"width":353,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cc9926686b37f40f","type":"text","text":"7. Although denying that, Aksara still thought about the Legends, and Sulinggih's question","x":2000,"y":6831,"width":250,"height":113,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"efae5566068c2753","type":"text","text":"But, alas. There had been no dawn for far too long. Bali has been in darkness under Karma's reign.","x":1097,"y":6377,"width":397,"height":83,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6d60dad4b56b4e9b","type":"text","text":"But i believe, I always believe that dawn will eventually come.","x":1097,"y":6460,"width":397,"height":98,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d4ff9b3a4eb6c60f","type":"text","text":"And Aruna will one day return to his chariot. and the light of the sun will return to us once more.","x":1097,"y":6558,"width":397,"height":81,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ed9012c672bed3c1","type":"text","text":"Pray tell me, child... Are you the one? Are you the dawn that we have been waiting for?","x":1097,"y":6639,"width":397,"height":76,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5b69d6e5175497d5","type":"text","text":"They say Aruna was born too soon into this world, He is a child of the dawn. ","x":1097,"y":6207,"width":397,"height":84,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9a944418f87afd43","type":"text","text":"The Sulinggih asked her to go on a walk with him.","x":2000,"y":6154,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8e7c5caa9c26ede2","type":"text","text":"5 He told her about the legends of Aruna, the figure that will liberate Bali","x":2000,"y":6336,"width":250,"height":127,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"34891653ed9b181b","type":"text","text":"Long ago, the people gathered here in this temple, it always brought me joy when someone walks through the gate.","x":1097,"y":5922,"width":353,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"84d7cdd48a614e4d","type":"text","text":"Yet now, I sit here, with only my memories to remember what once was.","x":1097,"y":6011,"width":357,"height":55,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"68efe24775b5922c","type":"text","text":"**In chapter 2, he welcomes Aruna in Pura Renon and gives her a place to rest awhile and gather her thoughts. He offers respite to Aruna that has been struggling to find her purpose amidst the chaos and battles she had recently fought. He also tells Aruna about **the prophecy of Bali’s liberation**. **A folk tale about a figure that will save Bali from evil**.**","x":1680,"y":5832,"width":250,"height":433},
		{"id":"788e2a6ecc03996d","type":"text","text":"6. She was asked the question of who she is, she is nobody, she is definitely not Aruna","x":2000,"y":6588,"width":250,"height":133,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cd6cd6c8ae47e2c4","type":"text","text":"Obstacle: Aksara is impatient","x":-677,"y":4806,"width":250,"height":62},
		{"id":"82f22c59dec82473","type":"text","text":"4. Garuda sees that Sulinggih might have a point, urges Aksara to listen to him whilst relaxing. She couldn't storm the Fortress tired.","x":2000,"y":5950,"width":250,"height":204,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"31d1a0a45da66dcc","type":"text","text":"Character:  STOIC | CALM | WISE","x":-677,"y":4648,"width":250,"height":55},
